msgid ""
"This Windows can't download Monet by itself: it needs Windows 10 (2018) or newer."
msgstr ""
"Tämä Windows ei pysty lataamaan Monet'ta itse: tarvitaan Windows 10 (2018) tai uudempi."

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:257
